msgctxt "lfg.playgroup_link_required"
msgid "To use Playgroup Live, at least one player must link their account. Run `/playgroup link` and try again."
msgstr "Per usare Playgroup Live, almeno un giocatore deve collegare il proprio account. Esegui `/playgroup link` e riprova."

